      ],
      "en": "That same night, the LORD’s word came to Nathan, saying,",
      "ko": "그 밤에 여호와의 말씀이 나단에게 임하여 가라사대",
      "source_text_hash": "85cd993f6411d363964748afe2f38479849f4e05a9594901131d4baea7bbb47e",
      "translation_text_hash": "b8931a57c61fda31ba1640d5fc8c00ecd6ae6f0bb34be86ae057466d6f2467af",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 밤에 여호와의 말씀이 나단에게 임하여 가라사대"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "b8931a57c61fda31ba1640d5fc8c00ecd6ae6f0bb34be86ae057466d6f2467af"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:2SA:7:5",
      "sequence": 8186,
      "chapter_label": "2SA 7",
      "verse_label": "5",
      "locator": {
        "book": "2SA",
