      "en": "Then David the king went in and sat before the LORD; and he said, “Who am I, Lord GOD, and what is my house, that you have brought me this far?",
      "ko": "다윗왕이 여호와 앞에 들어가 앉아서 가로되 주 여호와여 나는 누구오며 내 집은 무엇이관대 나로 이에 이르게 하셨나이까",
      "source_text_hash": "62192086f85690aaf5236084ef8173ddb05bc094104a1cae9481e03b891a0637",
      "translation_text_hash": "cbd81ff3f07a03035ba3ea8ab57dd1da05c94c80bd36f07bc5bdb97779608b13",
